      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 4/5 bed residence on c. 0.3 acre landscaped plot. Featuring a well maintained interior the property commands panoramic countryside views. Well located within walking distance of Skibbereen town and all its amenities.\r\nServices: Oil fired central heating, mains services, broadband"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 2.1m x 1.0m \r\nTiled floor, sliding glass door\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall - 3.4m x 1.8m \r\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 3.6m x 3.6m \r\nParquet floor, solid fuel stove with stone surround, panoramic countryside views\r\n\r\nDining Room - 4.8m x 3.6m \r\nWooden floor, open to kitchen\r\n\r\nKitchen - 4.2m x 3.2m \r\nPainted wooden kitchen, electric hob, oven, extractor, fridge freezer\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.2m x 2.1m \r\nTiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, shelving\r\n\r\nWashroom - 1.6m x 1.4m \r\nTiled floor, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\nStudio/Office - 3.2m x 2.8m \r\nWooden floor, sliding glass door, staircase to first floor \r\n\r\nOffice/Store - 5.5m x 2.4m \r\nWooden floor, storage\r\n\r\nInner Hall - 5.5m x 1.1m \r\nStairs to first floor, hotpress\r\n\r\nShower Room - 3.5m x 1.8m \r\nTiled floor, walk in shower, vanity unit\r\n\r\nToilet - 2.0m x 1.0m \r\nTiled floor, w.c.\r\n\r\nBedroom1 - 4.0m x 3.7m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 4.4m x 3.6m \r\nWooden floor, garden views\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.0m x 3.4m \r\nWooden floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.4m x 1.1m \r\nWooden floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 4/Office - 5.4m x 3.4m \r\nWooden floor, closet\r\n\r\nBedroom 5/Playroom - 3.8m x 3.4m \r\nWooden floor, storage\r\n\r\nShower Room 2 - 3.4m x 1.6m \r\nWooden floor, shower, wash hand basin, w.c.\r\n\r\n"
